cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Nubarashen landfill from orbit: traced area, 1986-2026"
abstract: >-
  The area of the Nubarashen landfill in Yerevan, Armenia, outlined by an AI model on
  31 cloud-free summer satellite frames from SPOT 1-5 and
  Sentinel-2, with every frame, the alignment of each scene, the exact
  rendering requests and the code that reproduces the areas.
